// B30. Escaping a string literal to IR was quadratic in THAT LITERAL's length, because both
// interning loops built the hex escape with `body += hex_of(...)`, one byte at a time.
//
//     2,000 bytes    14 MB
//     4,000 bytes    31 MB
//     8,000 bytes   100 MB      for ONE literal
//
// It survived because the compiler's own longest literal is 223 bytes and **no fixture in the
// suite had a big one** — so the cliff was under every user and none of us. A program embedding
// a SQL schema, an HTML template or a JSON fixture is not exotic; it is what an application
// looks like. After chunking: 8 MB, 9 MB, 9 MB, and a 32,000-byte literal costs 14 MB.
//
// This fixture exists to keep a literal of real size in the suite. It is deliberately 4,000
// bytes — under the old regime that alone cost 31 MB, and it is small enough not to slow the
// run. The `.stdout` pins its length, so a regression in the escaping shows up as a wrong
// answer rather than only as time nobody is measuring.
let big: String = "A 4,000-byte literal, which is the point: payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payload payloa";
print(len(big));
